WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.010
Can you accelerate at a steady speed?

00:00:04.010 --> 00:00:06.150
Yes!

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:09.490
Driving around a bend changes your direction.

00:00:09.490 --> 00:00:14.320
Velocity has direction, so it changes.

00:00:14.320 --> 00:00:21.013
That is acceleration, even if the speedometer doesn't move.
